@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"エマちゃんの証言は<br>成立しないわ。<br>処刑台には<br>侵入できる経路がない……<br>ある意味、<br>【<link=\"Objection_01_05_03_01\">密室</link>】だったの。|#0105Trial03_Margo001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"だから、<br>エマちゃんの<br>言ってることは<br>全部<link=\"Objection_01_05_03_02\">嘘</link>になるわね。|#0105Trial03_Margo002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そもそもさっきから<br>エマっちが言ってる<br>違和感とかさぁ……。<br>死体にあった口の傷なんて<br>大した問題じゃ<br>ないっしょ？|#0105Trial03_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ナノカも、<br>エマっちがアリサみたく<br>処刑台から地下に送って<br>凍死させたんじゃねーの。|#0105Trial03_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"他に<link=\"Objection_01_05_03_03\">ツジツマ</link>が<br>あわないようなことも<br>ないんだし<br>やっぱエマっちが<br>犯人確定でよくない？|#0105Trial03_Coco003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:で、でも！<br>地下には<br>ナノカちゃんの銃が<br>あったし……！<br>ナノカちゃんは<br>あそこにいたはずだよ！|#0105Trial03_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"銃なんて<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_03_04\">殺したあとに置く</link><br>ことだって<br>できるじゃん？|#0105Trial03_Coco004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……エマっちが<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_03_05\">見間違い</link>でもしてたなら<br>別だけどさ。|#0105Trial03_Coco005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL3,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:エマさんが<br>嘘をつくなんて……<br>そんなこと……。|#0105Trial03_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:どうかしらね？<br>罪を認めたくなくて<br>必死にも見えるわ。|#0105Trial03_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……ねぇ、エマちゃん。<br>この議論……<br>これ以上続ける必要は<br>あるのかしら。|#0105Trial03_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


