# Judge5-3-17

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:本当に地下から処刑台には入れないのかな……？<br>ゴクチョーとか管理者とか、<br>誰か入れるんじゃ……！|#0105Trial03_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

